        "r": 355.42013,
        "b": 430.95834999999994
      },
      "content": "This table shows the criteria for replacing the impeller:"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": "tbl_0059",
      "reading_order": 1513,
      "section": "Impeller replacement",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 142.6932373046875,
        "t": 431.4803771972656,
        "r": 558.9990234375,
        "b": 341.9978332519531
      },
      "markdown": "| Impeller parts   | When to replace                                                                                 |\n|------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Impeller vanes   | • When grooved deeper than 1/16 in. (1.6 mm), or • When worn evenly more than 1/32 in. (0.8 mm) |\n| Pumpout vanes    | When worn or bent more than 1/32 in. (0.8 mm)                                                   |\n| Vane edges       | When you see cracks, pitting, or corrosion damage                                               |"
    },
